[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0690","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0690.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59204","title":"Pillow JPEG2000 分块解码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pillow 是一个 Python 图像处理库。其 JPEG2000 解码模块在处理分块（tiled）图像时存在缺陷：`total_component_width` 变量在遍历所有图像块时持续累加，而非对每个块独立重置，导致后续块的 `tile_bytes` 计算值异常增大，进而通过 `realloc` 不断扩展解码缓冲区，最终造成内存耗尽。攻击者只需向目标应用发送精心构造的多块 JPEG2000 图像文件，调用 `Image.open(...).load()` 即可触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Pillow 8.2.0 至 12.2.0 版本，已在 12.3.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59204","GHSA-vjc4-5qp5-m44j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-21T19:17:12Z","remediation":"tags.<value>将 Pillow 升级至 12.3.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，可使用 pip install --upgrade 'Pillow>=12.3.0' 命令进行升级。如因业务原因暂时无法升级，建议在应用层对用户上传的 JPEG2000 图像进行格式校验，拒绝处理包含过多瓦片的图像文件，并对图像解码进程设置内存使用上限（如通过 resource.setrlimit 限制 RSS）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/13ada41172142f2fd9f0906f615a00ea623a11ca","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9704","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-vjc4-5qp5-m44j","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-59204.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b20bfc143159985d72e06c22492fa07d41b61e71/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59204.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59204.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6319d796586e052c159b72f452c1df7e848d6f10/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59204.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59204.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6319d796586e052c159b72f452c1df7e848d6f10/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59204.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/6dd9892dd68397ee98232ad0e1fed55a1599cf70/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59204.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-59204.yml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59204.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59204.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0690.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0689","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59203","title":"Python Pillow EPSImagePlugin 无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pillow 的 EPS 文件解析器（PIL/EpsImagePlugin.py）在处理 %%BeginBinary 指令时，直接将解析出的字节计数值用于文件指针相对偏移操作，未对负值进行校验。攻击者可在构造的 EPS 文件中插入负的字节计数（如 %%BeginBinary:-18），导致文件指针向后回退并反复重新解析同一指令，触发无限循环。Image.open() 因此陷入死循环并持续消耗 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.0.0 至 12.2.0 版本，攻击者仅需向使用 Pillow 进行图像解析、验证或缩略图生成的应用程序提供恶意 EPS 文件即可触发，无需调用 Image.load() 也无需启用 Ghostscript，影响范围涵盖图像上传服务、后台图像处理任务及 Web 服务等场景。Pillow 12.3.0 已通过增加字节计数非负校验修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59203","GHSA-pg7v-jwj7-p798"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-15T14:18:32Z","remediation":"将 Pillow 升级至 12.3.0 或更高版本：执行 pip install --upgrade \"Pillow>=12.3.0\" 并验证 Image.open() 对异常 %%BeginBinary 字节计数能正常抛出异常而非挂起。如暂无法升级，可在图像处理流程中为 Image.open() 调用添加进程级超时限制或 CPU 时间配额，避免单个恶意 EPS 文件耗尽 CPU；同时限制可上传 EPS 文件的来源，对用户提供的 EPS 文件增加文件类型校验，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/03992618118b4a76b6163cd72ab5ecd684133b83","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9708","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-pg7v-jwj7-p798","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-59203.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59203.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59203.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-59203.yml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59203.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0687","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59199","title":"Python Pillow 图像坐标堆溢写漏洞","description":"Pillow Python 图像处理库在 12.3.0 版本前存在堆越界写入漏洞（CVE-2026-59199，CVSS 7.5 HIGH）。漏洞源于 `Image.paste()`、`Image.crop()` 和 `Image.alpha_composite()` 等公开 API 在处理接近有符号 32 位整数边界（INT_MIN/INT_MAX）的坐标参数时，C 扩展层 `ImagingPaste()` 和 `ImagingCrop()` 使用有符号 `int` 运算导致整数溢出，绕过边界检查。在 RGBA 等 4 字节像素模式下，攻击者可构造特制坐标参数（如 `box=((1<<31)-W, 0, INT_MIN, 1)`），触发可控的向后堆下溢写入：目标偏移 `-4*W` 字节，写入长度 `4*W` 字节，内容来自攻击者控制的源图像像素数据。理论上可向后写入约 2 GiB 范围。攻击条件为：应用允许不可信用户控制传递给 Pillow 的图像操作坐标（裁剪框、粘贴框、叠加位置），无需私有 API、ctypes、自定义对象或畸形图片文件。利用方式通过公开 API 直接调用即可触发，PoC 演示了 `paste`、`crop`、`alpha_composite` 三条路径均可在 ASAN 下触发 heap-buffer-overflow，非 ASAN 构建下导致堆损坏并 abort。影响 Pillow < 12.3.0 所有版本，修复版本为 12.3.0，建议升级并限制不可信坐标输入。CVE 编号：CVE-2026-59199，CWE-190/CWE-787，CVSS 3.1: AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59199","GHSA-6r8x-57c9-28j4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-15T16:16:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pillow 到 12.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade pillow>=12.3.0）。若暂时无法升级，请在代码层面校验并拦截传入 Image.paste()、Image.crop()、Image.alpha_composite() 的坐标参数，拒绝接近 INT_MIN/INT_MAX（±2147483648）的极值坐标，防止有符号 32 位整数溢出触发堆越界写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/ceefc348eb3c3844c7f9796ef2cc3a7dd5fbba7b","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9703","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-6r8x-57c9-28j4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-59199.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59199.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-591xx/CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59199.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-59199.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0686","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59198","title":"Python Pillow TGA RLE 编码器堆越界读取信息泄露漏洞","description":"PyTorch TGA RLE 编码器在保存模式为“1”的图像时出现整数溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 IPv6 数据包触发该漏洞，导致 adjacent heap 数据被写入到生成的 TGA 文件中。受影响的版本涵盖了 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等操作系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，属于严重危害等级。主要影响范围为使用了 Pillow 图像库的软件应用，可通过调用 public save API（如 Image.save 时使用 TGA 格式和 RLE 压缩）进行触发。该漏洞的利用手段是利用编码器对每像素的字节偏移计算错误，导致大量 adjacent heap 内存被泄露至输出文件中，进而可能导致信息泄露和远程代码执行。Microsoft 已经在 2024 年 8 月的安全更新中修复了此漏洞，建议所有受影响的系统及时更新到安全版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59198","GHSA-fj7v-r99m-22gq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-14T20:18:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pillow 到 12.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade Pillow>=12.3.0）。若暂时无法升级，请避免使用 mode=\"1\" 模式配合 TGA RLE 压缩保存图片（即避免调用 im.save(..., format=\"TGA\", compression=\"tga_rle\") 或旧版 rle=True），改用无压缩或其他格式保存作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/eada3cbd7fb9963ee90673fb7b5270124a0d5f4b","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9709","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-fj7v-r99m-22gq","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59198.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/6dd9892dd68397ee98232ad0e1fed55a1599cf70/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59198.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59198.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-59198.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-591xx/CVE-2026-59198.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0808","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55651","title":"Easy!Appointments 预约管理系统 过度数据暴露导致预约接管漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments 1.5.2 版本的客户搜索端点存在过度数据暴露漏洞，已认证用户可通过该端点获取其他用户的预约哈希值。由于缺乏对象级授权控制，攻击者利用获取的哈希值可调用预约管理接口（如 /calendar/reschedule/{hash}），实现对其他服务提供者预约的查看、修改或删除，导致预约接管。该漏洞影响数据机密性和完整性，CVSS 7.1（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、低攻击复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互。版本 1.6.0 已修复，建议升级并限制搜索端点仅返回当前提供者的预约数据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55651","GHSA-4vmm-5qvc-w5p7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T16:42:11Z","remediation":"tags, and should be TOML compatible according to the skill rules.<value>升级 Easy!Appointments 到 1.6.0 或更高版本，修复 customers 搜索端点的授权验证漏洞。修改端点逻辑，确保仅返回属于认证用户的预约数据，同时加强对预约哈希值的访问控制。临时缓解措施：在防火墙中限制对 customers 端点的访问，仅允许特定 IP 地址。完成版本升级后，验证所有认证用户只能访问其 own 预约信息，确认预约劫持漏洞已修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-4vmm-5qvc-w5p7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/038ebe8769d42a55c13282848dec427251956ad1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/038ebe8769d42a55c13282848dec427251956ad1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55651.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-556xx/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-55651.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55651.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0759","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0759.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52841","title":"alextselegidis Easy!Appointments Google OAuth 授权绕过漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments（开源预约调度系统）1.6.0之前版本中存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-639）。`application/controllers/Google.php:278` 的 `Google::oauth` 方法将URL传入的 `provider_id` 直接存入会话而未校验调用者是否拥有该提供商，导致任意已登录的后端用户（管理员、服务提供者或秘书）可劫持其他服务提供者的Google OAuth绑定。攻击成功后，受害者的预约数据（含客户姓名、邮箱）将同步至攻击者的Google日历，攻击者还可通过删除日历事件来清除受害者的预约记录，或通过创建事件插入不可用时段。攻击条件：攻击者需拥有后端登录权限，且目标实例已配置Google Calendar OAuth同步功能。该漏洞CVSS评分3.1，危害等级低，已在1.6.0版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52841","GHSA-8hm4-r66f-29wr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T16:42:11Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Easy!Appointments 1.6.0 或更高版本，该版本在 `Google::oauth` 方法中增加了 `cannot('edit', PRIV_USERS) && (int) session('user_id') !== (int) $provider_id` 权限检查，阻止非管理员或非所属服务提供者绑定他人的 Google OAuth。如无法立即升级，可手动在 `application/controllers/Google.php:278` 的 `oauth` 方法开头添加上述权限检查逻辑作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/commit/4b2d245d2cd2058dc76e05f6eb65b26699268471","https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-8hm4-r66f-29wr","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-52841.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52841.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52841.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-52841.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/packagist/alextselegidis/easyappointments/CVE-2026-52841.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0759.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0759.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0759.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0758","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0758.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52840","title":"Easy!Appointments CalDAV连接测试服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments 是一款自托管的预约调度系统，其 1.6.0 之前版本的 CalDAV 连接测试功能存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。`Caldav::connect_to_server` 方法在 `application/controllers/Caldav.php:60` 处直接将用户输入的 `caldav_url` 参数传递给 Guzzle HTTP 客户端发起 `REPORT` 请求，未对 URL 的 scheme 和主机地址进行任何校验。已登录的后台用户（管理员、服务提供者或秘书）可通过构造指向回环地址、RFC1918 私有地址或链路本地地址的恶意 URL，探测部署环境内部网络中的服务。Guzzle 异常路径会将上游 HTTP 状态码及约 120 字节的响应体内容反射到 JSON 响应的 `message` 字段中，形成半盲 SSRF，攻击者可据此对内网服务进行指纹识别和端口扫描。该漏洞影响所有 1.6.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 2.7，危害等级低，已在 1.6.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52840","GHSA-pm5p-7w5h-jm5q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T14:18:23Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Easy!Appointments 1.6.0 或更高版本（commit 6eb9336a），该版本在 CalDAV 连接测试中增加了对 URL scheme 和私有地址的校验。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层限制 `/index.php/caldav/connect_to_server` 接口的访问权限，仅允许受信管理员 IP 调用，并确保后端服务（MySQL、phpMyAdmin 等）不暴露在同一 Docker 网络中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/commit/6eb9336a91cfb276379506625e81f5bd9ed3a536","https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-pm5p-7w5h-jm5q","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-52840.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52840.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52840.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52840.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0758.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0758.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0757","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0757.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52839","title":"Easy!Appointments 跨提供商预约注入漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments 是一款自托管的预约调度系统，其 `appointments/store` 和 `appointments/update` 接口存在授权绕过漏洞。系统在 `appointments/search` 中正确实现了服务商隔离过滤，但 `store` 和 `update` 端点仅检查通用预约权限，未验证提交的 `id_users_provider` 字段是否属于当前会话。已认证的服务商可通过构造包含他人服务商 ID 的 POST 请求，向其他服务商的日程中注入预约或将已有预约重新分配至他人名下。此外，`store` 端点存在写入后崩溃的 bug：未授权数据先写入数据库，随后控制器因类型错误返回 500，导致攻击者收到错误响应但数据已持久化。该漏洞影响 1.6.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 3.3，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52839","GHSA-w8xc-8g92-v77h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-29T17:16:52Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Easy!Appointments 1.6.0 或更高版本，该版本在 `appointments/store` 和 `appointments/update` 端点中强制校验 `id_users_provider` 与当前会话提供者 ID 一致。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对非管理员角色拦截 `id_users_provider` 参数提交，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则阻断包含外部 `id_users_provider` 的 POST 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/commit/725eafa647308846ce887657db12771a829e42ef","https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-w8xc-8g92-v77h","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-52839.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52839.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52839.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52839.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0757.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0757.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0756","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0756.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52838","title":"Easy!Appointments 预约系统 disable_booking_message 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments 是一款开源在线预约系统，其后台预约设置页面允许管理员通过富文本编辑器自定义\"预约已禁用\"提示消息。该消息值被直接存储至 `disable_booking_message` 配置项，并在前端公共预约页面的 `booking_message` 视图中通过 `<?= vars('message_text') ?>` 未经任何 HTML 转义或过滤直接渲染输出。已认证的管理员可在该字段中注入恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码，当启用预约禁用模式后，任何访问公共预约页面的未认证用户都会触发执行存储的恶意脚本，导致存储型跨站脚本攻击。攻击者可利用此漏洞在目标域下执行任意 JavaScript、窃取用户凭证、篡改页面内容或将访问者重定向至恶意站点。该漏洞影响 Easy!Appointments 1.6.0 之前的所有版本，已在 1.6.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52838","GHSA-996f-334j-67g7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T17:17:03Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Easy!Appointments 1.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 `disable_booking_message` 输出进行转义处理。如无法立即升级，可在 `application/views/pages/booking_message.php` 中将 `<?= vars('message_text') ?>` 改为 `<?= e(vars('message_text')) ?>` 以转义 HTML 输出，或通过 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 规则拦截包含 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等恶意标签的 POST 请求到 `/index.php/booking_settings/save` 路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/commit/629a0415f54f75556c17f4f5d9c77fda1fdbdeae","https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-996f-334j-67g7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-52838.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52838.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52838.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52838.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0756.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0756.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0756.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0755","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0755.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52837","title":"Easy!Appointments 客户敏感信息未授权泄露漏洞","description":"Easy!Appointments 是一款自托管的预约调度系统，其预约重排页面 `/index.php/booking/reschedule/{appointment_hash}` 在未经验证的情况下将完整的客户记录以内联 JavaScript 形式嵌入响应中，且未对字段进行白名单过滤。攻击者仅需获取 12 字符的 `appointment_hash`（该哈希以明文形式出现在重排邮件、确认页面 URL 及操作员日历链接中），即可通过一次匿名 GET 请求获取该客户在 `ea_users` 表中的全部字段，包括邮箱、电话、地址、自定义字段、时区、语言及 LDAP DN 等敏感个人信息。该漏洞影响 v1.5.2 及之前所有版本，v1.6.0 已修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52837","GHSA-xgr6-pqjv-3pf8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T15:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-29T17:16:52Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Easy!Appointments v1.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 Booking.php 中 script_vars() 传入的 customer_data 做字段白名单处理，仅保留 id/first_name/last_name。如无法立即升级，可临时关闭确认邮件中的重排链接（修改 Email_settings 模板），或在配置中启用 disable_booking 关闭公开预约页面以降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/commit/40bb0b31b531540bc9006efce4220eb0a437ed2b","https://github.com/alextselegidis/easyappointments/security/advisories/GHSA-xgr6-pqjv-3pf8","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-52837.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52837.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52837.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52837.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0755.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0755.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0275","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45263","title":"FacturaScripts CSVExport CSV公式注入漏洞","description":"FacturaScripts 的 CSVExport 功能存在 CSV 公式注入漏洞（CWE-1236），低权限认证用户可在客户名称等字段中插入以 =、+、-、@ 等开头的恶意公式载荷。Core/Lib/Export/CSVExport.php::writeData() 在生成 CSV 时未对单元格首字符进行公式触发前缀检查，直接将原始值写入文件。管理员通过 ListCliente 页面导出 CSV 后，在 Excel 或 LibreOffice 中打开时公式自动执行，可触发 DDE 命令执行或凭据窃取。攻击者可利用任意具备数据写入权限的低权限账号种植载荷，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45263","GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在 Core/Lib/Export/CSVExport.php 的 writeData() 方法中对以 =、+、-、@、制表符、回车符开头的单元格值自动添加前导单引号改为纯文本格式，同时需在 writeHeader() 和 XLSExport::getCursorRawData() 中应用相同修复。升级至包含该补丁的版本。临时缓解措施：在 Excel 中禁用 DDE 自动执行，在 LibreOffice 中设置宏安全级别为高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts/security/advisories/GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg","https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0274","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45262","title":"FacturaScripts REST API 认证后SQL注入漏洞","description":"FacturaScripts 是一款开源 ERP/会计系统，其 REST API 的 filter 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞。漏洞位于 `Where::sqlColumn` 方法中，攻击者可通过在 filter 参数中注入括号绕过过滤，构造恶意 UNION SELECT 语句。即使仅持有受限 API Key（仅 `clientes` 资源的 GET 权限）的认证攻击者，也可通过发送特制请求获取管理员密码的 bcrypt 哈希值等敏感数据，导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 FacturaScripts 主分支版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45262","GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj"],"sources":["cve","ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级至 FacturaScripts 2026.3 及以上版本（当前最新为 2026.5），该版本已对 REST API 的 filter 和 sort 参数进行模型字段白名单校验，阻止恶意 SQL 注入。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 UNION/SELECT 等关键词的 API 请求参数，并限制 ApiKey 的 fullaccess 权限为最小必要范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts/security/advisories/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj","https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0274.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0268","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44300","title":"OpenCost /serviceKey 端点未授权凭证覆盖注入漏洞","description":"OpenCost 存在未授权文件写入漏洞，位于 /serviceKey 端点。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该端点直接覆盖 GCP 服务账号密钥文件，无需任何认证即可实施攻击。该漏洞可导致 Kubernetes 集群内服务中断、凭据窃取及权限提升，影响 OpenCost 所有版本。建议用户立即升级修复版本或限制 /serviceKey 端点的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44300","GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5","GO-2026-5974"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenCost 至 v1.119.1 及以上版本，该版本通过 adminAuthMiddleware 要求所有管理端点（包括 /serviceKey）必须配置 ADMIN_TOKEN 环境变量方可访问。在 Helm 部署中设置 opencost.exporter.adminToken 值。若无法立即升级，通过 Kubernetes NetworkPolicy 限制对 OpenCost 服务 9003 端口的网络访问，仅允许受信任的客户端 IP；同时在容器启动参数中移除 CONFIG_PATH 可写目录挂载，或将配置目录设为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencost/opencost/security/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0268.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0268.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0501","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15685","title":"Ollama downloadBlob 数组索引验证不当拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ollama 的 downloadBlob 函数中存在数组索引验证不当漏洞（CWE-129），远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统发送特制请求，触发越界内存访问，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Ollama 部署环境，攻击者利用此漏洞可导致系统不可用，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15685"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:46Z","updated":"2026-07-14T20:59:10Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Ollama 至最新版本（≥0.8.0），该漏洞在 0.7.1 及之前版本的 downloadBlob 函数中存在数组索引验证缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可发送特制请求触发越界内存访问导致拒绝服务。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制 /api/blobs/ 端点的请求速率和载荷大小，或通过防火墙限制对 Ollama API 端口的非信任来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-403/","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/45fa3110991b1e32f1dbd5486d359b38b77d645b/data/vuln/ollama/CVE-2026-15685.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15685.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-15685.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-13/TIER_3_CVE-2026-15685.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15685.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-15685.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15685.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c7vp-gjfc-x6p8/GHSA-c7vp-gjfc-x6p8.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/ollama/PYSEC-2026-3450.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15685.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0501.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0501.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0500","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15684","title":"Glarysoft Glary Utilities 链接跟随本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Glarysoft Glary Utilities 的磁盘清理功能存在链接跟随（Link Following）本地权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于 Disk Clean 组件在处理文件删除操作时未正确验证符号链接，允许已获得低权限代码执行能力的本地攻击者通过创建目录链接（junction）诱使服务以 SYSTEM 权限删除任意文件。攻击者可利用此漏洞将权限提升至 SYSTEM 并执行任意代码。攻击需要本地访问及低权限用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15684"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T16:45:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Glary Utilities 至最新版本（≥6.45，2026-07-20 发布），该版本可能已修复 Disk Clean 功能中的符号链接跟随漏洞。如无法升级，建议限制非管理员用户对 Glary Utilities 的访问权限，或移除 Disk Clean 工具的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-402/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15684.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-13/TIER_3_CVE-2026-15684.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15684.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-15684.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15684.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-q8cx-4p2w-v29c/GHSA-q8cx-4p2w-v29c.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15684.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-16_11-05-13.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-22271.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a7af5a678b55af1e4884963bdb9ea6fae03d5b34/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-156xx/CVE-2026-15684.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0500.toml"}]